==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Base Set|Kadabra|32}} from the {{TCG|Base Set}}, as was its '''Super Psy Bolt''' attack (as '''Super Psy''').
**Super Psy Bolt's Japanese name is derived from that of {{m|Confusion}}, a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Kadabra}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

